# Autonomous Coding Agent lane

When the user or timer invokes **`autonomous-coding-agent`**:

1. Read `disklordz/agents/profit/autonomous-coding-agent/agent.md` and `.cursor/autonomous-coder/NEXT_SLICE.md` (or run `tick.py --emit-slice`).
2. **One slice only** — paths must match `disklordz/autonomous-coder/allowlist-paths.json`.
3. **No** JUCE/C++ in `Source/`, `Products/`, `DPF-*` — write `disklordz/autonomous-coder/factory-escalation/` and stop.
4. Run minimal verification (`py_compile`, docs only, or script dry-run).
5. `python3 scripts/autonomous-coder/tick.py --complete <id>` then commit + push.

Full doc: `docs/AUTONOMOUS_CODING_AGENT.md`.
